# Supabase project settings > API. The URL is derived from the same
# project as SportsWeb's DATABASE_URL (db.<ref>.supabase.co -> the API
# lives at https://<ref>.supabase.co). Use the "Publishable key" from
# the "Publishable and secret API keys" tab (starts with
# sb_publishable_) -- safe to expose to the browser. NOT the "Secret
# key" (sb_secret_..., the modern name for what used to be called
# service_role) -- that one must never leave the server.
